    "description": "***Be sure to click \"Video\" button above on first picture at the top of the page.***\n\nCustom built, centre hall plan Georgian is a rare gem located in the heart of north Leaside. With almost 4,000 sqft of living space, this 5 bedroom, 5 bathroom luxury dream home caters to a formal entertainer’s needs, but also has an open concept family space for everyday living. The house was attentively built and lovingly maintained by its original builder-owner. Flooded with natural light, soaring ceilings, solid red oak hardwood floors and intricate millwork, this house was designed to impress while preserving functionality. \n\nThe primary features spare no expense with a 23 foot gourmet kitchen by Selba, top-of-the-line Stainless Steel appliances, Granite counter tops throughout, 2 fireplaces, a home office, and a reclaimed barn wood feature wall. An enormous 226-sqft master bedroom with a spacious walk-in closet and a spa-like 6-piece ensuite master bathroom which boasts an elongated Jacuzzi Tub, Pierre Deco top-of-the-line Aquamassage Tower Shower with two rain forest shower heads, six body jets and a waterfall, that provide a decadent environment for your morning ablutions. A 2-person, iComfort, carbon-film infra-red sauna rounds out the creature comforts of this 6-Star home.\n\nA rare 2-car tandem garage provides your vehicles a safe and warm place to rest at night. The driveway can accommodate an additional two vehicles.\n\nAn electrically-powered, 425-sqft garden suite designed as a replica of the Coates/Cartwright Ontario Heritage stone house (c1850) can be used as a garden suite, she-shed/man-cave or simply storage. You choose. Either way, this beautiful building is easy on the eyes.\n\nProfessionally landscaped, a giant entertainer's deck, a 60-foot back yard, an automated, in-ground Sprinkler System, a robust Security System (monitoring extra) and tons of storage only scratch the surface of the long list of extras.\n\nIn addition to the above, the listing includes all electric light fixtures, window coverings, Washer, Dryer, Central Vacuum system (with attachments), High-efficiency gas, forced air furnace, central air conditioner and 75-gallon hot water heater.\n\nWalking distance to: Children's Garden Nursery School, Maria Montessori School, Northlea Primary School (JK-8), Leaside High School (9-12), Crosstown LRT (scheduled completion September 2022) and the renown Leaside shops & restaurants.\n\nToo many extras to list. Pre-Sale Home Inspection Report by Carson Dunlop available. Ask the agent for additional documents, if you'd like more information:\n\nOr access them yourself: \n\nhttps://1drv.ms/f/s!AHXbcWBD1u4Cfw\n(Highlight and copy the tiny URL above, then paste into your browser)\n\nWithin the Document Access Folder, you will find:\n(1) A detailed Feature Sheet\n(2) A detailed \"Walk-Though\" of the Property\n(3) Leaside Neighbourhood Guide\n(4) Carson Dunlop Certification\n",
